{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-7aa851"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3e7856"}, "note": "葬礼競技のある英雄の死と、名も残らない者たちの墓地。死を集合的に囲い込む形式と、個別の名を数えない形式。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0043"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-fdcee5"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-25a7b5"}, "note": "一通の手紙として書かれた最後の言葉と、日付表として告知されるモデルの停止。宛先の具体性が違う。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0044"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-15a3c8"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-855a7e"}, "note": "埋葬されない遺体と、朽ちない身体を着る復活。どちらも遺体の扱いが共同体の秩序を決める。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0045"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-fb74ae"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-4c1795"}, "note": "死を最も固有な可能性とする読みと、死を他者との関係から問う読み。同じ語彙で逆向きの力が働く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0046"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-644e8f"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-25691d"}, "note": "五段階という順序の仮説と、二つの向きのあいだの振動というモデル。喪を直線で書くか、往復で書くか。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0047"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d6f173"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-e11b22"}, "note": "十七年かけて友の死を歌い続けることと、絆を断たずに形式を変えて続けること。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0048"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-f8d923"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1b6589"}, "note": "知覚の途切れとしての死と、読まれる限り続く生。死を感覚の側から書くか、流通の側から書くか。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0049"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-b9f531"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-25a7b5"}, "note": "行いを測る尺度として組織された地獄と、停止日と代替品の一覧として組織された引退。どちらも死後を表で管理する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d004a"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-d16be0"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-6422ad"}, "note": "死者の simulation を終わらせる手続きと、AI コンパニオンとの関係の終わりに区切りを与える設計。終わる対象が死者か関係か。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d004b"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-ec827d"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-089fc2"}, "note": "モデルからデータを消す技術的な困難と、死後に残るデータを誰が管理するかという制度の困難。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d004c"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-33459a"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-67ef22"}, "note": "墓石の表裏に分かれた声と、死者を背負って墓に入る女。どちらも死者の声を生者の側の形式に通す。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d004d"}
{"left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-4702db"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-94fad2"}, "note": "死を名指さず夢の運動だけを残す句と、死んだ名を数えて売買する制度。名の有無が逆である。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d004e"}
{"left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-102"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-044"}, "note": "引用符の内側の声を数えた問いから、墓の不在を数える問いへ。数える対象が語から沈黙へ移った。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d004f"}
{"left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-103"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-056"}, "note": "宛名の抽象化を問うた問いへ、遺言と手紙と許可という形式の違いを返す。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0050"}
{"left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-105"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-082"}, "note": "訂正と抹消の問いに、削除が再学習を要求するという技術的制約を返す。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0051"}
{"left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-106"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-051"}, "note": "感応と帰属の問いに、関係の終わりを喪として記述できるかという形で接続する。", "created_at": "2026-10-24", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-d0052"}
